 it feels like God has asked you to do that,

558
00:24:06,140 --> 00:24:08,700
 and yet he hasn't delivered you to it,

559
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:10,140
 what do you say to yourself?

560
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:13,340
 What are you thinking to yourself?

561
00:24:13,340 --> 00:24:17,380
 And then what does God have to say about those thoughts?

562
00:24:17,380 --> 00:24:18,540
 I know for some of you, you're here,

563
00:24:18,540 --> 00:24:21,700
 and you're like, man, God doesn't see me.

