00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:37,820
 But Psalm 34, 17 says,

569
00:24:37,820 --> 00:24:39,100
 "When the righteous cry for help,

570
00:24:39,100 --> 00:24:41,220
 "the Lord hears them and delivers them

571
00:24:41,220 --> 00:24:42,900
 "out of all their troubles."

572
00:24:42,900 --> 00:24:45,220
 Some of you, you think to yourself in moments of waiting,

573
00:24:45,220 --> 00:24:46,780
 God doesn't care about me.

