 It says in 2 Peter,

1054
00:48:07,180 --> 00:48:13,300
 with the Lord one day is as a thousand years

1055
00:48:13,300 --> 00:48:15,460
 and a thousand years is as one day.

1056
00:48:15,460 --> 00:48:18,580
 And yet the Lord is not slow to fulfill his promise.

1057
00:48:18,580 --> 00:48:20,540
 Some count slowness.

1058
00:48:20,540 --> 00:48:22,540
 You might think he's slow, but he's not.

1059
00:48:22,540 --> 00:48:24,540
 He's patient.

1060
00:48:24,540 --> 00:48:26,760
 He's patient towards you

1061
00:48:26,760 --> 00:48:28,320
 because he's not wishing any should perish,

1062
00:48:28,320 --> 00:48:29,620
 but that all should reach.

1063
00:48:30,620 --> 00:48:32,180
 Repentance.

1064
00:48:32,180 --> 00:48:38,100
 God does not have to wait for anyone or anything.

1065
00:48:38,100 --> 00:48:41,500
 And yet he has chosen to wait for you.

1066
00:48:41,500 --> 00:48:45,780
 And the reason why is 'cause he wants for you.

1067
00:48:45,780 --> 00:48:46,620
 He wants for you.

1068
00:48:46,620 --> 00:48:48,020
 Let me pray that you would believe.

1069
00:48:48,020 --> 00:48:54,020
 Lord, I'm so grateful for tonight.

1070
00:48:54,020 --> 00:48:58,560
 I'm grateful for these people.

1071
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:01,880
 But God, I'm grateful

1072
00:49:01,880 --> 00:49:08,480
 that because they've come,

1073
00:49:08,480 --> 00:49:11,720
 my confidence can rise all the more than you have come to.

1074
00:49:11,720 --> 00:49:19,440
 Because it is your people that you want.

1075
00:49:19,440 --> 00:49:25,240
 I think about all the things we want in life,

1076
00:49:25,240 --> 00:49:26,920
 all God that we wait for.

1077
00:49:27,640 --> 00:49:29,840
 (gentle music)

1078
00:49:29,840 --> 00:49:32,680
 Lord, we'll take none of it with us when we go to heaven.

1079
00:49:32,680 --> 00:49:38,720
 But you, you have always wanted for us

1080
00:49:38,720 --> 00:49:40,640
 and you have waited for us

1081
00:49:40,640 --> 00:49:43,800
 because you know I will take you with me.

1082
00:49:43,800 --> 00:49:45,160
 I will take you to heaven.

1083
00:49:45,160 --> 00:49:50,760
 Some of you, you need to place your faith in him.

1084
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:53,760
 And you need to receive from him

1085
00:49:53,760 --> 00:49:54,880
 the gift of eternal life

1086
00:49:54,880 --> 00:49:56,000
 that is found only,

1087
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:59,600
 if freely in Christ Jesus.

1088
00:49:59,600 --> 00:50:04,440
 Others of you tonight, you need to give up control.

1089
00:50:04,440 --> 00:50:06,340
 You need to surrender and lay it down.

1090
00:50:06,340 --> 00:50:09,880
 Some of you are so very weary.

1091
00:50:09,880 --> 00:50:14,680
 Come, come to me all who are weary and heavy laden.

1092
00:50:14,680 --> 00:50:17,320
 For in me there is rest.

1093
00:50:17,320 --> 00:50:20,640
 God, we wish to wait for you.

1094
00:50:22,560 --> 00:50:24,560
 I think the tendency now would fill

1095
00:50:24,560 --> 00:50:29,600
 the rush of all God that we need to get onto.

1096
00:50:29,600 --> 00:50:31,920
 But wouldn't that defeat the point of waiting?

1097
00:50:31,920 --> 00:50:35,040
 Waiting is slow.

1098
00:50:35,040 --> 00:50:37,600
 Waiting takes time.

1099
00:50:37,600 --> 00:50:41,240
 Waiting's in no rush

1100
00:50:41,240 --> 00:50:45,880
 because it knows all that I have already wanted for

1101
00:50:45,880 --> 00:50:48,960
 is here with me now.

1102
00:50:48,960 --> 00:50:50,640
 You are here with us now, oh God.

1103
00:50:51,640 --> 00:50:53,760
 And so we wait for you.

1104
00:50:53,760 --> 00:50:57,600
 Let's wait for him as we worship.

1105
00:50:57,600 --> 00:50:59,240
 Let's wait for him as we respond.

1106
00:50:59,240 --> 00:51:01,600
 Let's wait for him.

1107
00:51:01,600 --> 00:51:11,600
 [BLANK_AUDIO]

